{"title": "Food Supply Table 3", "pageid": 13550, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Food_Supply_Table_3", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Food supply tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><br>\nThe <b>Food Supply Table 3</b>, also known as <code>Supplies_Food_3</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supplies_Food_3+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supplies_Food_3+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a non-leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> containing medium <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">camp supply</a> items. It is referenced in many drop tables.\n</p><p>Its name seems to be based on the fact that the average Supplies value of this table is approximately 3.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_Table\">Drop Table</span></h3>\n<p><i><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Food Supply Table 3}}</code>.</i></i>\n</p><p><i>The average drop from this table is worth 3.1 <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a>.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Biscuit\" title=\"Biscuit\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/FOOD_Biscuit_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Biscuit_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images